  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Rarely, I get thrown back in my home world at the start of the loading screen (just after clicking on \"go\").\n\nUnfortunately, I was unable to determine what really causes that issue,  it happened to me twice, when I walked though a portal. (first time in a private world that got an update, so we dropped a portal to rejoin the instance). It's a rare bug, and hard to reproduce. it doesn't seem to happen in any particular worlds, it feels random.\n\nThis never happened to me before in the past, so it's definitely a regression since the latest beta update.",
